## 3. Matrice RBAC

### 3.1 Rôles (6)

| Rôle | Profil | Contexte |
|------|--------|----------|
| **admin** | Propriétaire / DG | Partout, tout |
| **gerant** | Gérant de dépôt | Bureau, supervision |
| **magasinier** | Réception, stock, inventaire | Dépôt physique |
| **caissier** | Encaissement, vente comptoir | Caisse |
| **livreur** | Livraison terrain, encaissement | Mobile |
| **comptable** | Lecture + exports + réconciliation | Bureau |

### 3.2 Permissions (48 au total, regroupées par ressource)

Convention : `resource.action` — ex: `sale.create`, `sale.validate`, `consignment.adjust`.

```
product.read        product.create      product.update      product.delete
packaging.read      packaging.create    packaging.update    packaging.delete
stock.read          stock.adjust        stock.inventory     stock.reconcile
purchase.read       purchase.create     purchase.receive
sale.read           sale.create         sale.validate       sale.cancel     sale.discount_over_5pct
delivery.read       delivery.create     delivery.complete   delivery.return
consignment.read    consignment.sale_out consignment.return_in consignment.adjust consignment.loss
credit.read         credit.grant        credit.block        credit.write_off
cash.open           cash.close          cash.move           cash.reconcile
customer.read       customer.create     customer.update     customer.delete
user.read           user.create         user.update         user.deactivate
report.view         report.export       audit.view          settings.update
